@baseUrl = http://localhost:5125

### 1. Apply all pending migrations (Migrate Up)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/up
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get applied migrations history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/history
Accept: application/json

### 3. Inspect database schema tables and columns
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/tables
Accept: application/json

### 4. Rollback to version 202601010001 (Delete Profiles and remove Status column)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/rollback/202601010001
Accept: application/json

### 5. Check schema after rollback
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/migrations/tables
Accept: application/json
